        "heldOutCohorts": [
          "G8-10"
        ]
      },
      "unit": "split-specification",
      "status": "assumed",
      "basis": "Earlier two cycles train; later two evaluate. Canonical grade group G8-10 is excluded from all training; verify support before running.",
